    <h1 class="screen__title">About Teach Direct</h1>
    <p class="screen__lead">Teach Direct is a free, open-source app of scripted lessons a parent teaches from a phone: reading, from the first sounds to stories, and math, from counting to the facts. Every lesson is scripted, so a parent with no training can teach it well.</p>
  </header>

